{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行者淨身口意，至尊像前，應念：我及眾生，積迷造罪，無救無歸。大士洪慈，為歸為救。又念：大士法身，及十\n方三寶，體常徧滿，無所不在。與我現前心性，平等無二。起深信解，如奉慈顏。敷具拱立，唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "總一禮已，嚴持香華，如法供養。唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至此停唱，燒香散華，至心想云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想已起云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮已，次復合掌讚云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讚已一禮，添香致敬，唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜下想云：能禮所禮性空寂，感應道交難\n思議。我此道場如帝珠，釋迦如來影現中。我身影現如來前，頭面接足歸命禮。下皆准此，唯改佛名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想云：諸佛法身如虗空，化事住世難思議，我皆影現化事前，一一皆\n悉歸命禮。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "總三禮，想云：真\n空法界如虗空，常住法寶難思議，我皆影現法寶前，莫不皆悉歸命禮。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想偈如佛，但改菩薩名字，下皆倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮竟，\n如前想偈畢，復作是念："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是念已，胡跪唱言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱已，五體\n投地，復作是念："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是念已，應起胡跪，唱言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或一說，或三說，起立唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮已，起立正身，運想一切三寶，徧滿虗空。安坐法\n座，一一迴身，如法旋遶。此身如影，音聲如響，普徧十方。上供三寶，下警羣靈，勿令心散。和雅唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或三稱，或七稱，旋遶既畢，迴身至法座前正立，至心唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問訊畢，次至靜室，或念地藏菩薩名，或持滅定業真言，或觀大士平等法身，或作唯\n心識等二種觀道，唯信唯篤，則必能滅障，必證法忍矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T13n0412_p0780c16"}
